## Introduction

This notebook demonstrates web scraping techniques to collect book information from the [books.toscrape.com](https://books.toscrape.com/) website using Python’s requests and BeautifulSoup libraries. The code retrieves data such as book **titles, prices, availability, image URLs, ratings, and product page URLs**.

